@startuml
!include style.puml
participant CommandBox as UI UI_COLOR
participant LogicManager as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant AddressBookParser as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant Command as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ModelManager as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant VersionedAddressBook as History MODEL_COLOR
participant Storage as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

UI -> Logic : execute(text)
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(text)
Parser --> Logic : command
note over Logic, Parser
ParseException stops execution before checkpoint or save.
end note
Logic -> Command : isDataChanging()
Command --> Logic : true
Logic -> Model : createCheckpoint()
Model -> History : copy working list, share frozen history index
History --> Model : data, immutable snapshot references, pointer
Model --> Logic : checkpoint (including effective predicate)
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
Command -> Model : mutate working data\nor undoAddressBook() / redoAddressBook()
break execution fails (CommandException / RuntimeException)
    Command --> Logic : exception
    Logic -> Model : restoreCheckpoint(checkpoint)
    Model -> History : restore working data, history, pointer
    Model -> Model : restore effective predicate directly
    Logic --> UI : rethrow original exception
end
Command --> Logic : tentative result
Logic -> Command : getHistoryAction()
Command --> Logic : COMMIT / NAVIGATE
opt history action is COMMIT
    Logic -> Model : commitAddressBook()
    Model -> History : commit()
    break commit fails (RuntimeException)
        Model --> Logic : exception
        Logic -> Model : restoreCheckpoint(checkpoint)
        Model -> History : restore working data, history, pointer
        Model -> Model : restore effective predicate directly
        Logic --> UI : rethrow original exception
    end
end
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(current data)
note right of Storage
Serialize complete JSON, write and force protected sibling,
then atomically replace the employee file.
Replacement is the commit point; no fallible work follows.
Handled failures before replacement preserve file bytes.
end note
alt save succeeds
    Storage --> Logic : return
    Logic --> UI : result
    UI -> UI : clear command text
else serialization or save fails before replacement
    Logic -> Model : restoreCheckpoint(checkpoint)
    Model -> History : restore working data, history, pointer
    Model -> Model : restore effective predicate directly
    Logic --> UI : rethrow CommandException or RuntimeException\n(convert I/O errors to existing CommandException)
end
note over Logic, Storage
Read-only commands skip checkpoint/rollback
and employee-file saving.
isDataChanging() derives from getHistoryAction().
end note
@enduml
